{# The privacy policy's paragraph on a captcha provider shipping none of its own (providers/captcha-<slug>.en.html.twig, which a site can add under templates/bundles/c975LUiBundle/) #}
<h3 data-legal-id="third-parties.captcha">Form protection ({{ captchaProvider.name }})</h3>
<div>
	Forms are protected against bots by {{ captchaProvider.name }}. As soon as you start filling in a form, this service receives your IP address and information about your browser, to estimate whether a human sent it, and processes them under its own privacy policy.
</div>
